C frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3b73c3e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "551f886", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0530f25", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "03997c0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "818e563", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "feb7b1e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a633b7f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0c84614", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1fc3c59", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8cdfe47", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "de16a68", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5e88c43", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fb99e93", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a35c43c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "6a4263c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f134d3a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c15416a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "eb1a36d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1736020", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "ddeefbf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b2ae6c3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a8ad14d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "dc8b9fa", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "65dcc91", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "54087fa", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "be23bbf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6e26a70", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Web pro jóga studio</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5ea5a03", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích (rezervace, e-shop, jazyky) a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d76d9e1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0baed4c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "0eb9040", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ba81309", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – web pro jóga studio", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d7b12a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "ff92e01", "tab_title": "Jak řešit permanentky a rezervace?", "tab_content": "<p>Napojíme rezervační systém, kde si studenti koupí permanentku a sami si zapisují lekce.</p>"}, {"_id": "53414f7", "tab_title": "Má smysl nabízet online lekce?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano, jako doplněk – rozšíří studio o klienty, kteří nemohou dorazit osobně.</p>"}, {"_id": "fc00e70", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá vytvoření webu – jóga studio?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší s rezervacemi nebo e-shopem za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "3f395b7", "tab_title": "Budu si web upravovat sám?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Stavíme na WordPressu a Elementoru – texty, ceník, fotky i nové stránky změníte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}, {"_id": "8cac167", "tab_title": "Tvoříte weby jen v Jeseníku?", "tab_content": "<p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale weby tvoříme pro klienty z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží online, místní rádi potkáme osobně.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "c3c4602", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "cd18ddb", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "27133fb", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a80c3c3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c326a60", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ec76560", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete web pro jóga studio?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "48323cd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Napište pár vět o svém podnikání nebo rovnou zavolejte. Ozvu se obvykle do jednoho pracovního dne.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c04d340", "el